    "Ayurveda reads excess evening stimulation as Vata–Pitta aggravation: restless mind, delayed sleep, irritable mornings. The prescription matches evidence — morning sunlight, daytime exertion, calm sensory evenings.": "Ayurveda reads excess evening stimulation as Vata–Pitta aggravation: restless mind, delayed sleep, irritable mornings. The prescription matches evidence — morning sunlight, daytime exertion, calm sensory evenings.",
    "Khana khilane ke liye mobile dikhana padta hai — kya karein?": "Khana khilane ke liye mobile dikhana padta hai — kya karein?",
    "Ye aadat bhookh ke sanket bigadti hai. 2 hafte ka plan: fixed meal time, khud khane do (gandagi chalegi), 25-min me meal khatm — shuru me khana kam khayega, phir bhookh laut-ti hai.": "Ye aadat bhookh ke sanket bigadti hai. 2 hafte ka plan: fixed meal time, khud khane do (gandagi chalegi), 25-min me meal khatm — shuru me khana kam khayega, phir bhookh laut-ti hai.",
