    "Nutrition": "Nutrition",
    "Iron deficiency is among India's commonest paediatric issues — and one of the most fixable causes of poor appetite, restless sleep and inattention. This guide covers signs, sensible testing, and food-first correction.": "Iron deficiency is among India's commonest paediatric issues — and one of the most fixable causes of poor appetite, restless sleep and inattention. This guide covers signs, sensible testing, and food-first correction.",
    "Signs parents notice": "Signs parents notice",
    "Pale inner eyelids/lips/nails, chewing ice/clay (pica), restless legs at night, breathless on play, poor appetite and flagging attention.": "Pale inner eyelids/lips/nails, chewing ice/clay (pica), restless legs at night, breathless on play, poor appetite and flagging attention.",
