    "Haemoglobin + ferritin/iron studies confirm; dose and duration follow paediatric protocol (typically months, not weeks) with recheck. Vitamin C with iron-rich meals aids absorption; tea with meals blocks it.": "Haemoglobin + ferritin/iron studies confirm; dose and duration follow paediatric protocol (typically months, not weeks) with recheck. Vitamin C with iron-rich meals aids absorption; tea with meals blocks it.",
